= The End of 1923

The year that began with French soldiers in Essen ends with a new currency, a general with emergency powers, and a Republic that is still standing, to the surprise of many of its citizens.

Five years ago, a hundred-odd delegates founded the Communist Party of Germany in the Prussian Landtag. Since then it has been through civil war, risings, splits, congresses beyond counting and the whole of the inflation. [? if kpd_banned = 1 : It enters 1924 banned. ?][? if kpd_banned = 0 : It enters 1924 legal, which in itself is something. ?]

It is time to take stock.

- @finish: See how the party stands.

@finish
